    {
      "A00073 SLIM-EXCESS 5KG": "Slim-Excess is an ingredient commonly used in cosmetic and skincare products aimed at reducing the appearance of fat and improving skin firmness. It is often included in formulations for slimming creams or anti-cellulite treatments. This product comes in a 5-kilogram container, suitable for manufacturing or bulk use."
    },
    {
      "MATCHA POWDER": "Premium Matcha powder, crafted with shade-grown techniques for an ultra-fine submicron texture. Available from Daily to Ceremonial Grade (100% Tencha), it features a vibrant emerald green color and a fresh, mellow flavor with minimal bitterness. Rich in chlorophyll and amino acids, this easily soluble powder is perfect for beverages (1-3%), baking (2-5%), and ice cream (4-8%). Beyond its premium taste, it naturally enhances focus, supports eye health, and helps prevent tooth decay—all backed by Halal, USDA Organic, ISO 9001, and FSSC 22000 certifications."
    },
    {
      "LIBREL BMX 25KG": "Librel BMX is likely a specialized ingredient used in various formulations, such as in cosmetics, pharmaceuticals, or industrial applications. Specific details about its function or properties may vary based on the exact product and usage. This product is provided in a 25-kilogram container, suitable for bulk use or manufacturing."
    },
    {
      "D-PANTHENOL CARE 25KG": "D-Panthenol is a liquid form of vitamin B5, often used in skincare and haircare products to keep skin and hair hydrated and healthy. It helps with moisture retention and soothing the skin. This product comes in a 25-kilogram container, ideal for bulk use."
    },
    {
